      <title>高通9月1日起芯片涨两位数 中国手机供应链成本直接抬升</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260901/%E9%AB%98%E9%80%9A9%E6%9C%881%E6%97%A5%E8%B5%B7%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E6%B6%A8%E4%B8%A4%E4%BD%8D%E6%95%B0-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E9%93%BE%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8A%AC%E5%8D%87/</link>
